                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "I need help setting up automated workflows for our customer onboarding process. Specifically, I want to:\n\n1. Send a welcome email when a new customer signs up\n2. Create a task in our project management tool\n3. Schedule a follow-up call after 3 days\n4. Add them to our newsletter\n5. Track their engagement metrics\n\nCan you help me configure all of these steps? I also want to make sure that each step has proper error handling and retry logic in case something fails.",
